<title>UK: LME copper finishes PM kerb near lows.</title>
<headline>LME copper finishes PM kerb near lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Wraps up kerb $32 lower at $2,278. The cash/threes backwardation was little changed from Monday's levels at $250/$255, but some $20 narrower than at its AM peak.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Down $21 at $1,563, depressed by copper.</p>
<p>ZINC - Also lower, failed to re-hurdle the $1,500 level.</p>
<p>LEAD - Down sharply.</p>
<p>TIN - Softer.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Stable.</p>
</text>
